														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4853728">
									

<p>That’s what is gonna be put forth towards the middle-end of the narrative. Theories start getting put forth that maybe there is no anomaly being used by this other foundation but maybe that foundation is itself the anomaly, and that they’ve been hidden for so long because they’ve been employing the same methods as our SCP Foundation to remain hidden from society and all other groups. Historically, they likely didn’t rise in the same way, but their own documentation would disagree. Some things are best left for the reader to speculate about and I think that the beginning of this foundation is one of those things.</p>

							</div>

								
					
