			<div class="content" id="post-content-4853721">
									

<p>Fully reasonable views, of course. In the end, I sacrifice whatever I have to sacrifice to make the story work the way I want it to. The extent to which it works for each reader is totally a personal decision, and I certainly have no problem with that! Thanks for leaving your thoughts, I appreciate it. (In terms of justification: in my mind, the fact that nobody actually thought this thing was anything but a pile of bones meant that Brenda's chat with Tiamat didn't call down the reprisal it probably ought to have. Pretty thin? Maybe.)</p>

